   2026-10-24: Keyboard and ARIA tables written from TreeViewControl.razor (markup), HandleKeyDown in TreeViewControl.Operations.cs and
   treeKeyboard in wwwroot/browser-capabilities.js; Parameters and TreeNode rows re-read against TreeViewControl.Appearance.cs,
   TreeViewControl.Operations.cs, TreeViewModels.cs and TreeViewData.cs (FolderStyle and Children defaults, TreeIndentPixels and ShowIcons
